{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-levi-form-defect","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:levi-form-defect","kind":"definition","title":"Matter as Frobenius failure via the Levi form","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-frobenius-hopf-substrate"],"tags":["levi-form","frobenius-failure","matter","defect"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.LeviFormDefect","text":"levi-form-defect.md","leanSource":"levi-form-defect.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:levi-form-defect\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda</code> be the Frobenius form of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code> and, for a point <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p</code> in the spectral fiber, let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{L}_p : T_p^{1,0}A \\times T_p^{0,1}A \\to \\mathbb{C}</code> be the Levi form at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p</code>. The <strong>matter locus</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Sing}(\\lambda) \\subset \\mathrm{Spec}(A)</code> is the set of points <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p</code> with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{L}_p \\neq 0</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/levi-form-defect.md","heading":"Definition","number":"8.13.1","page":"b/def-levi-form-defect","qa":{"counts":{"pass":80,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":11,"unknown":0,"stale":68},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Core.AlgebraicSubstrate.LeviFormDefect","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/levi-form-defect.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
